# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo, regardless of each
# contributor's local `core.autocrlf` — prevents whole-tree CRLF/LF
# false-modified noise, and keeps stamp-kit-assets.mjs's content hash
# (computed over file bytes) stable across Windows/Linux checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Contribute PRs append bullets under `## Unreleased` in parallel — the built-in
# union driver keeps both sides on a LOCAL merge instead of a conflict. GitHub's
# web merge ignores merge drivers, so merge contribute PRs locally (README,
# "สำหรับทีมดูแล platform"). Check the result: union never drops lines, but it
# can duplicate a line both sides added.
plugins/*/CHANGELOG.md merge=union
